sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Customer
    participant FE as React My parcels page
    participant CC as ParcelCancelController
    participant CS as ParcelCancelService
    participant SS as ParcelStatusService (M5)
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant MQ as RabbitMQ

    Note over C,MQ: Step 1 - choose a reason
    C->>FE: Click Cancel on a Booked parcel
    FE-->>C: Ask "Why are you cancelling?" (reason list, comment if Other)
    C->>FE: Pick a reason and click Confirm cancellation

    Note over C,MQ: Step 2 - cancel (one transaction)
    FE->>CC: POST /api/v1/parcels/{id}/cancel {reason, comment} (JWT, @Valid)
    CC->>CS: cancelForCustomer(customerId from JWT, id, request)
    CS->>DB: SELECT parcel owned by this customer
    DB-->>CS: Parcel (status = CREATED)
    CS->>DB: UPDATE parcels SET cancel_reason, cancel_comment
    CS->>SS: changeStatus(id, CANCELLED, "CUSTOMER", customerId, note)
    SS->>SS: StatusTransitionRules.validate(CREATED, CANCELLED)
    SS->>DB: UPDATE status, INSERT status_history
    SS->>SS: raise ParcelStatusChangedEvent
    CC-->>FE: 200 ParcelDetailResponse (status = CANCELLED, cancelReason)
    FE-->>C: Card shows Cancelled and the reason

    Note over SS,MQ: After the database commit only
    SS-)MQ: publish parcel.status.changed (notification + webhook queues, WebSocket push)

    alt Not the owner or unknown parcel
        CC-->>FE: 404 error JSON
    else Parcel already picked up
        CC-->>FE: 409 error JSON (only CREATED can be cancelled)
    else Reason Other without a comment
        CC-->>FE: 400 error JSON
    end
